=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>"}], "type": "post_instructions"}]}, {"template_override": 1, "stimuli_ids": [], "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 0, "selected": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "id": 1, "selected": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "type": "question"}]}], "type": "RSLT", "id": 11, "_data": [{"contents": [], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}], "type": "group"}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}], "type": "lab_options"}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn6le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn6le10ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn6le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn6le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: Oh, this bridge reminds me of my childhood. My grandfather used to take me on walks across this bridge. We would each throw one small stone into the river.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: My father used to take me to the park, but I haven't spent much time with my grandparents. They used to visit Cambridge only on holiday weekends.<br>"}, {"time": "18500", "image": "engenn6le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: My grandparents were newcomers to the U.S. They came to the U.S. soon after they were married. They have worked hard since then to establish a good life for their family.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: You told me that your grandfather wanted you to learn the history of the country.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>: He used to tell me, \u201cIf you know where this country has come from, you can play a strong role in where it's going.\u201d He has read me stories about the American Revolution since I was a kid. We would go to the library once a week, and he would help me pick out a book."}, {"time": "50000", "image": "engenn6le10ob09re2img05.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: So, you used to read lot in your free time and watch baseball games on TV?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Peter</span>:  Yeah! And I ran around outside.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Well, I certainly learned a lot about Boston's history from you."}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "A Quick Coffee Break"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "Things My Grandfather Used to Say"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "B1.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe past experiences in a range of social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "childhood"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the period of time when a person is a child"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He felt this bridge reminds him of his childhood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about past experiences."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to remind"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to make someone think about something again"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The bridge reminded the man of his own childhood."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to establish"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to begin or create something that is meant to last for a long time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: His grandparents worked hard to establish a good life for their family."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud03"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "kid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a young person; informal word for \"child\""}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He remembers good times when he was a kid."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud04"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to play a role"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to take or play an active part in something"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The boy was told to play a role in where his country is heading."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud05"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to run around"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to run from one place to another playfully with no particular purpose."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: He use to run around outside a lot as a kid."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn6le10ob09aud06"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Since when?"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use the preposition <span class=\"strong\">FOR</span> with a period of time, for example: a few days, half an hour, two years.<br>   You use the preposition <span class=\"strong\">SINCE</span> with the time when the action started, for example: <span class=\"italic\">Last year, June 8, I met you.</span> "}, {"type": "example", "content": "They have worked hard <span class=\"strong\">since</span> then to establish a good life for their family. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "He has read stories about the American Revolution <span class=\"strong\">since</span> I was a kid. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "I have read at night <span class=\"strong\">for</span> 6 years."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Used to and Would for Past Habits "}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use used to to express a past action and/or a state.<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Examples:</span> <br> <span class=\"italic\">When I was a child, my father used to take me on walks across this bridge.</span> (action) <br> <span class=\"italic\">We used to live in Cambridge.</span> (state) <br><br>  Notice that in the negative and the question forms you do not use -d.<br>  <span class=\"strong\">Examples:</span> <br> <span class=\"italic\">Which park did you use to go? <br> My mother didn't use to read a lot of stories.</span><br> <br>  You cannot use used to with a time reference + a number. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Incorrect:</span>  <br> <span class=\"italic\">I used to spend time with my grandparents in Cambridge for 5 years.</span> <br> <span class=\"strong\">Correct:</span>  <br> <span class=\"italic\">I used to spend time with my grandparents in Cambridge every day.</span> <br><br>  When you express a series of past actions, you start with used to, then continue with would. <br> <span class=\"strong\">Example:</span> <br>  <span class=\"italic\">When I was a child, we used to walk in the park. We would play there, and we would throw one small stone into the river.<span><br><br><span class=\"italic\">Would</span> is not used unless you know that the time frame is in the past, while <span class=\"italic\">used to</span> does not require this."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Used to\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Would\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">My grandfather used to take me on walks across this bridge. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We would each throw one small stone into the river.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">He has read me stories since I was a kid. </span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We would go to the library once a week.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn6le10ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a dialogue of 10 lines with your partner about a childhood experience each of you has had with a grandparent or parent."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about the experience in detail. Use the Present Perfect tense."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Talk about what you used to do or any routine you had together."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice the dialogue several times aloud with your partner."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about a childhood experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I apply the proper action words about a past experience."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I express past habits or routine."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I practice the dialogue with my partner."}]}]}